<section class="source-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="laboratory-jurisdiction-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>JURISDICTION</p>
      <h2 id="laboratory-jurisdiction-heading">CAPABILITY IS NOT CASH. INTENTION IS NOT RETURN.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="larchive-spec-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>DEPLOYMENT</h3>
        <p>Date, evidenced basis, funding type, source reference, and present status.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>CLASS</h3>
        <p>Instrument, bench infrastructure, training, experiment, research object, or service.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>CAPACITY BASIS</h3>
        <p>Resources retained for productive use, kept separate from consumables and cash.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>PATHWAY</h3>
        <p>The intended productive use is recorded as a hypothesis, never as booked revenue.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>RETURN</h3>
        <p>Realized return remains zero until cleared value can be attributed to the deployment.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>AUTHORITY</h3>
        <p>SLUSH owns cleared liquid movements. Le Laboratoire records what those cleared resources became.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="evidence-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="laboratory-sequence-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>OPERATING SEQUENCE</p>
      <h2 id="laboratory-sequence-heading">DEPLOY. CLASSIFY. TEST. ATTRIBUTE.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="progression-list">
      <li class="complete">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>CLEAR</h3>
        <p>Begin only after the liquid or non-cash movement is evidenced by its owning private record.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="complete">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>CLASSIFY</h3>
        <p>Distinguish durable productive capacity from training consumables and unresolved intent.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="complete">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>OPERATE</h3>
        <p>Record purpose, experiment state, maintenance, and the intended profit pathway.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="active">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>ATTRIBUTE</h3>
        <p>Recognize return only when cleared value can be linked to the capability by evidence.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

