<section class="evidence-band signal-chain-dossier" aria-labelledby="laboratory-boundary-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label fi-caption-box"><span class="fi-prompt-marker" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>RECORD BOUNDARY</p>
      <h2 id="laboratory-boundary-heading">PUBLIC METHOD. PRIVATE OPERATIONS.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li>
        <h3>LOCAL CORE</h3>
        <p>The loopback instrument stores deployment records, source references, notes, and audit history outside the public tree.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>NO FINANCIAL FICTION</h3>
        <p>Basis, productive capacity, liquid cash, hoped-for profit, and attributable realized return remain separate fields.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>SHARED INSTRUMENT</h3>
        <p>Le Laboratoire and <a href="/inventory/">L'Inventaire</a> use one local data and API core while preserving distinct jurisdictions.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
